  "card_fields": [
    {
      "number": 1,
      "name": "硬节点",
      "text": "**1｜硬节点**  \nR03 / P02：元春必须死；死因、精确日期开放。H03：若死在婚前，必须给后续婚期真实丧期缓冲。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          288,
          290
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          10731,
          10879
        ],
        "text_sha256": "7b07450675f278ff1efcf644414265baca7a5fb5ebf11844af8c211c73c3dd2d"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "name": "最强处",
      "text": "**2｜最强处**  \n死讯先撞进厨房/饭单与门房体系；“别满院乱嚷”；不同人知情层次不同；最终压到潇湘馆，紫鹃开始记夜醒、饭药。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          291,
          293
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          10879,
          11058
        ],
        "text_sha256": "0cfef6f0481993352d24c875a50ba4f86d94e251aec392de447bbcff6c796433"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "name": "最薄处",
      "text": "**3｜最薄处**  \n“消息”与“正式服制命令”可分得更清；丧务常例如何在数日形成可再补一个过渡。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          294,
          296
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          11058,
          11194
        ],
        "text_sha256": "d51d7fc35c96626406fb3a7723fb38291db8438236435b1a6018fa3752707cfd"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "name": "缺失情节",
      "text": "**4｜缺失情节**  \n84-S1门上不知道先领谁；S2死讯与细节分开；S3饭食、服色、走动规则在数小时内改变；S4延迟传到黛玉。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          297,
          299
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          11194,
          11356
        ],
        "text_sha256": "282d1ba6980cce17e5054bc6037105db1e18dc18dd0494166eae3d45d99fb745"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "name": "人物",
      "text": "**5｜人物**  \n宫中传讯者、门房、凤姐/平儿、王夫人、针线房、厨房、紫鹃。不要新增宫廷内幕知情者。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          300,
          302
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          11356,
          11496
        ],
        "text_sha256": "066483255f9082bde799f746197e8eef35c721845b3e707ed1da2dfb8c5c830e"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "name": "文化",
      "text": "**6｜文化**  \n第38禁补；不写挽联展览。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
