        ],
        "text_sha256": "c84c7cd5fc18cd127989e04b61baa8ff4c205108e2dc1a836f2740c518f63cb8"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "name": "诗文身份",
      "text": "**7｜诗文身份**  \nG09完整挽诗/祭辞淘汰；只许讣帖、祭单等流程文字。作者诗无。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          306,
