        "byte_range": [
          11769,
          11846
        ],
        "text_sha256": "92207bfae00af2c70673ed29313e77712e0ffe6d80bfdeb55113a3b3d6635298"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "name": "职业",
      "text": "**10｜职业**  \n门房、传令、针线、厨房承担社会机制。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          315,
