        ],
        "text_sha256": "07ae172c2ea20250db3ffaf85c28c31b995c334faa29395e37c00bd0e8b85d71"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 12,
      "name": "保留",
      "text": "**12｜保留**  \n饭单、传讯人袖上水、压低声音、紫鹃“夜醒二次”、黛玉嫌扇子“瞧着冷”。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
